    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Mugger Party ? </strong></h2><br><strong>Mugger Party is a horror-adventure game that turns a night of party with friends into a nightmare. Can you unravel the mystery and survive the night? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ecff4180190a3f877c05c93e0dcb8fdf.poster.avif?t=1719835848\" width=690 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ecff4180190a3f877c05c93e0dcb8fdf.webm?t=1719835848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ecff4180190a3f877c05c93e0dcb8fdf.mp4?t=1719835848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chapter System </li><li>Dialogue with NPCs </li><li>Make your own choice to get a special ending </li><li>Realistic VHS Effects </li><li>Scary Sounds and Musics </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now! </strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1719835848\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1719835848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731150/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1719835848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
